     The ggeetteeuuiidd() and ggeettuuiidd() system calls are expected to conform to
     ISO/IEC 9945-1:1990 (“POSIX.1”).

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ggeettuuiidd() function appeared in Version 1 AT&T UNIX.  The ggeetteeuuiidd()
     function appeared in Version 4 AT&T UNIX.

